{{Quote|Ruggedized for extended operation beyond the reach of paved logistics. This armor's heavy plating is intended for the "unpaving" of hostile territory, providing a mobile bulkhead for Helldivers who don't know the meaning of "environmental obstacles".|[[Armory]] Description}}

'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is a set of [[Armor#Heavy-0|Heavy Armor]] in ''[[Helldivers 2]]''.

== Acquisition ==
The [[Armor#Helmet-0|helmet]] was awarded to all Helldivers who have participated in any stage of the [[Campaigns#Lightning Intercept|Lightning Intercept Campaign]] on July 27th, 2026. The body armor was given out to all Helldivers who participated in any stage of the [[Campaigns#Permanent Enclosure|Permanent Enclosure Campaign]] on August 11th, 2026.

== Passive Ability ==
{{Armor Passive Info Panel|Kinetic Displacement Mitigation}}

== Trivia ==
* The KDM-500 Outrider is the first armor set where the helmet and body armor were announced separately.
** The Helmet was given as a reward for [[Campaigns#Lightning Intercept|Operation: Lightning Intercept]].
** The Body Armor was given as a reward for [[Campaigns#Permanent Enclosure|Operation: Permanent Enclosure]].

